	},
	{
		{"fg", id=1, path=":fg/005/", file="bz05301", face="tat_z0501203", x=0},
		{"mwf", path=":fa/005/", file="fac_0501203"},
		{"vo", ch="sen05", path=":vo/005/", file="sen050307780"},
		{"text"},
		line=778,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"vo", ch="sen11", path=":vo/011/", file="sen110308820"},
		{"text"},
		line=784,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030260"},
		line=784,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"I can't leave her all alone.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Elsa's put her own life on the line to save Imperials, and I want to be there to see it through.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"But can I really just forsake my duty?",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades have worked tirelessly for the past three years in order to bring about this day.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"So many of us have paid the ultimate price, and their faces flash through my mind.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, you head to Yogarasu District.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Elsa's risking her life to save Imperials, isn't she?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What sort of Imperial would you be to ignore that?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Akari speaks as though she sees right through me.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't you dare let her die.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But you─”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll protect Miyaguni. You go to Elsa.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"The two of them nod in firm agreement.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, the palace is all yours.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"I leave the Sworn Blades behind and sprint towards Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Miyaguni, are you sure about this?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't ask me that.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What, too scared to kill Okonogi without Soujin there?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Please. Don't go selling me short.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Counting on you, Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"With our headquarters at the epicenter, crimson flames are spreading all across Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"The alleyways are teeming with residents desperately scrambling to evacuate.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Masses of panicked civilians clog every intersection, preventing any orderly movement.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"The winding alleys that ordinarily conceal the district's shady dealings now only serve to impede its evacuation efforts.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Where in the world could Elsa be?",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"I see Republican uniforms here and there among the evacuees, but I catch no glimpse of the most important person of all.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"I leap across the burning roofs in search of her.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"The screech of incoming attack aircraft interrupts my search.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're coming!”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"A squadron of five planes screams in low across the horizon.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"If they're allowed to drop their bombs, Yogarasu District will be reduced to ash.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"That said, I couldn't possibly cut them out of the sky.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Unless─",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"I recall one of the many tall tales passed around by the warriors at Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Apparently, during the air raid on the Warrior District three years ago, Kokuan-dono brought down an enemy bomber with a single swing of his blade.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"He must have used the Sickle Leaf.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"I clench my spellblade in my hands.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"I have no other options.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I won't let you get away with this.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"I slowly exhale, gathering all the power in my body within my core.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"After concentrating every fiber of power in my being, I allow it to flow unhindered into my arms.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Though there's no visible outward change, I feel my arms swelling with several times their usual strength.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Unable to be contained within the limits of my body, the surging torrent of power floods into my spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"In that same instant, the lead aircraft releases its deadly payload.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"That steely harbinger of death languidly tumbles end over end, as though mocking the residents desperately running for their lives below.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Teiaaaaaaaahhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"I hurl a shockwave of air and void through the sky.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"If my trajectory is even a little bit off, Yogarasu District will become a sea of flames.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Hundreds of lives will be extinguished in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"And the chances of Elsa's survival will dwindle ever closer to zero.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Please... Please!",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"The bomb plummeting through the sky explodes as though it encountered an impassable barrier of air.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"But this isn't the end.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"The remaining attack aircraft all release their bombs one after another.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oooaaaaaaarrghhh!”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Three, four separate times, I swing my blade through nothing but empty void.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"A large cluster of bombs explodes as one enormous fireball midair.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Even so, I didn't manage to destroy all of them.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Three still tumble out of that great net of flames and continue their perilous descent.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Khh!”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"The moment I grind my teeth in despair─",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"A mysterious light runs through all the remaining bombs.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"The roofs of the district below glow a vivid red.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"─Someone intercepted them just in time.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun?! What are you doing here?!”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"An astonished voice rings out directly beneath me.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa!”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"I leap down from the roof, landing right in front of Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you okay?!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Fortunately enough, somehow.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"She grimaces, her face covered with ash and streaked with blood and sweat.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"She must have been running around Yogarasu District this whole time.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Shouldn't you be with the Sworn Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I came to save you.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Elsa's eyes go wide with disbelief.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What in the world were you thinking?!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Isn't your mission way more important than me?!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're more important to me, and so I came here. That's all there is to it.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ah! Oh... ooh...”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Left at a loss for words, all Elsa can manage to do is show me a petulant frown.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“W-Well, suit yourself...”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But more importantly, was it you who just destroyed those bombs?”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The first few, at least.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But I had nothing to do with that last explosion.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That was yours truly.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You did that?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"It's inconceivable that an ordinary soldier, not even a warrior at that, could shoot down a falling bomb.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Republic has weapons capable of doing that?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, 'the Republic' might not be the most accurate way of putting it─”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"The smile instantly vanishes from Elsa's face.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"More attack aircraft are coming.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun, bring me up to the rooftops.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You got it.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"I should listen to her first and ask questions later.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Wrapping an arm around her slender waist without a second thought, I immediately kick off from the ground.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thanks, Tokita-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Elsa disentangles the arm she'd wrapped around my neck and assumes a kneeling position on the roof.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"She unholsters a revolver and carefully takes aim at the sky.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The burnished metal of the firearm is engraved with intricate patterns resembling a warrior's spellcrest.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is that an Artifact?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's a prototype built by the Army's R&D division.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Her weapon gleams with a golden light.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"As though it has a will of its own, all the light from the surroundings slowly coalesces around a single point within the barrel.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Lustrous gold turns to incandescent white, bright enough to burn my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"The attack aircraft close in right above us.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun, say a prayer.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"They release their deadly ordinance.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I put my faith in you and your aim.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well then, there's no way I'm gonna miss now.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"One after another, dazzling bolts of light tear across the night sky.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"But they do not follow a straight line.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Drawing elegant curves and jagged zigzags, they effortlessly pierce the falling bombs.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You got them!”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There's still more!”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"The bullets of light continue their impossible trajectories.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"As though possessed of their own will, they single-mindedly hunt down all the remaining bombs.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"An intense shockwave ripples across Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kh!”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Aaaahh!”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"I catch Elsa in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Shrapnel from the blast digs into my exposed back.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun?!”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't worry about me.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You did a great job.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Ten, twenty seconds pass by, yet the skies remain clear.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Elsa managed to shoot down all the bombs.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Not a single one landed among the civilians below in Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Looks like my prayers were answered.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Elsa reverently touches her forehead to the barrel of the still-glowing gun in her hands.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's one scary gun. I'm glad it isn't being aimed at us.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't be so sure just yet.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"But she immediately shows me a grin.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm kidding.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you saying you're no longer an enemy of the warriors?”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yep. You can finally rest easy.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"But as soon as the words leave her mouth, Elsa's eyes go wide.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"That was as much a declaration of goodwill as an admission that she ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"was",
{"/font"},
" our enemy up until now.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun, I...”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's fine. We're just as guilty.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Right.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I suppose you warriors won't ever...”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"She slowly trails off.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"The relationship between us was always one of the fox and the hound from the very beginning.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Needing no further words between us, we simply stand in silence and look down at Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"We've stopped any further bombing, but the fires still rage on.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"There's sure to be further casualties unless someone steps in to direct the chaotic evacuation.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We should help evacuate the residents. Can you rally your men?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's what I came here to do in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Elsa and I share a brief nod and descend from the rooftop.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"After a while, we manage to successfully evacuate almost all of the residents.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"There are still more than a few casualties.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"But if Elsa's troops hadn't stepped in, there would have surely been orders of magnitude more.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"I can still remember how she sounded on the phone while attempting to direct the evacuation.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"I won't soon forget those desperate screams from the very depths of her heart.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"It's obvious that her actions today were a spontaneous impulse of her conscience, free from any premeditation.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Here, clean your face with this.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Elsa wipes her face with the handkerchief I hand her.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"The handkerchief soon turns completely black with soot and ash.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is now finally a good time?”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Who ordered the bombing of Yogarasu District?”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Warren.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“He never intended to go back to the mainland. He's holed up in the Government-General right now.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then that means the Imperial Palace is─!”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"If Warren knew all about the Sworn Blades' plans, the Republican Army must be closing in on the palace as we speak!",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari's in danger!”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You go to the palace. I'll go to the Government-General.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And do what?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Put Warren under arrest. But that might not be so easy...”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Elsa quickly checks the number of bullets left in her handgun before replacing the magazine.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You'll betray the Republic... and your father?”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I already decided that I would fight for my fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even if it's my own father... Even if I know I can't hope to win... None of that matters.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“'The last and final modicum of virtue left within you,' was it?”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Elsa solemnly nods.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Warren didn't even hesitate at the thought of massacring all these civilians.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“To be able to justify an act so monstrous, so barbaric...”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No, his principles don't matter. All you need to know is that I'll never forgive him.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Is that why she put her own life on the line to evacuate the residents of Yogarasu District?",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"There's a gaping hole in her uniform lapel where all her medals used to sit.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"It demonstrates her resolve louder than any words.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm going with you to the Government-General.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we can take out the army's command center, it'll be a big help to the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That place is like a fortress, you know? You'd be risking your own life.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's why I refuse to let you go alone.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thank you, Tokita-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Her deep ultramarine eyes stare right into mine, showing not one trace of doubt or hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"In the face of this endlessly pure expression, nothing else matters. Not nationality or status or class, not past grudges or bygone enmities, none of it.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"The only thing I know is that in this moment, Elsa Valentine is one of the people I trust most in all the world.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"I'm clearly not the only one, as her subordinates start dutifully forming up behind her.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Many of them are wounded or unarmed, and every last one of them is covered in soot and ash.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"They, too, selflessly risked their own lives to save the civilians, and I know I can fight alongside them without any hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"We only have around a hundred men still in fighting condition, compared to the twenty thousand Republican troops garrisoned in the Republican occupation zone.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"To call us woefully outnumbered would be an understatement.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"But the eyes of every last soldier burn with righteous anger towards Warren.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"The man who would indiscriminately massacre civilians and his own countrymen alike deserves nothing less.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Let's go.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. Let's show them what we're really capable of.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
